[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9603.349, "timestamp": "02:40:03", "text": "「無料キットの企画に参加しているのか？」と言った。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9606.469, "timestamp": "02:40:06", "text": "キットを無料で配布するんですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9608.71, "timestamp": "02:40:08", "text": "ほぼ間違いない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9609.83, "timestamp": "02:40:09", "text": "つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9610.71, "timestamp": "02:40:10", "text": "私は「一体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9652.389, "timestamp": "02:40:52", "text": "いいえ、実際にはラグは発生していません。"}]